flowchart LR
    User[Dog owner] --> UI[Desktop UI]
    UI --> Core[Application core]

    Core --> Profiles[Profiles and consent]
    Core --> Sessions[Video sessions]
    Core --> Reports[Reports and export]

    Sessions --> Storage[(Local video storage)]
    Core --> DB[(Local database)]

    Core -->|Analysis request| Worker[ML worker]
    Storage -->|Video frames| Worker

    Worker --> Pose[Pose estimation]
    Pose --> Features[Movement and pose features]
    Features --> Classifier[Behaviour classifier]

    Classifier -->|Events, timestamps, confidence| Core
    Core --> Timeline[Behaviour timeline]
    Timeline --> UI
    Reports --> UI